Data Source Attribution
=======================

This dataset incorporates data from the following sources:

1. O*NET Database
   - Source: U.S. Department of Labor, Employment and Training Administration
   - License: Public Domain (U.S. Government Work)
   - URL: https://www.onetonline.org/

2. MIT OpenCourseWare
   - Source: Massachusetts Institute of Technology
   - License: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
   - URL: https://ocw.mit.edu/
   - Note: Derived work is transformative (metadata extraction only)

3. College Scorecard
   - Source: U.S. Department of Education
   - License: Public Domain (U.S. Government Work)
   - URL: https://collegescorecard.ed.gov/

4. University Course Catalogs
   - Sources: UC Berkeley, Stanford, UIUC, Cornell, KTH, Edinburgh
   - License: Public information
   - Note: Course descriptions are factual information

